@@section 1
@@title SQ-SRM Snow! Real Magic fold-in part A: melting, magma, walk-through, Immersive Weathering, grass, seasons, 2026-11-25 ([snow_real_magic.md](../snow_real_magic.md) 4, 5b, 8; TODO `mod-integration #14` to `#19`, `#26`)
@@date 2026-11-25
@@jars creativecommon creativecompat creativecalendar
@@sources feature_writeup/snow_real_magic.md development/creativeCompat/src/main/java/com/SaintAlfonzo/creativecompat/compat/SnowRealMagic.java kubejs/data/creativecompat/kubejs/tags/melting_tags.js kubejs/data/creativecompat/kubejs/tags/passthrough_tags.js
@@text
@@text Full pack with Snow! Real Magic 6.5.4 (Kiwi 8.3.6). Group A superflat (grass at y -61), each case 12 or more blocks
@@text from the others; a bot keeps the area random-ticking. Snowy plants are placed with block entity data:
@@text `snowrealmagic:snow[layers=N]{Block:"minecraft:poppy"}`. Snow! Real Magic's own config is written on the first boot:
@@text the rows that need the pack's values (writeup 4 step 10) set them with `qrun.py toml` before boot 1.
