@@table
## SQ-SRM-01 | Boot with Snow! Real Magic: the fold-in mixins apply, Serene Seasons keeps its melt
@group A
@commands Boot 1; grep the boot log
@pass no `Critical injection failure`, no `InvalidInjectionException`; `[creativecalendar] Snow! Real Magic loaded: Serene Seasons still melts snow and ice` once; no `[creativecompat] snowrealmagic ... is outside the tested range`; `[melting] tags:` line present
@fails the Calendar line missing: Snow! Real Magic's merged callback renamed (CalendarMixinPlugin.dropSrmMeltCancel); a Compat mixin failing: a changed Snow! Real Magic target (SrmWorldTickMixin, SrmSnowCollisionMixin are require = 0, SrmGrassSpreadMixin and IwSnowMeltSrmMixin are not)
@boot 1
bootexpect \[creativecalendar\] Snow! Real Magic loaded: Serene Seasons still melts snow and ice
bootreject Critical injection failure|InvalidInjectionException
bootreject \[creativecompat\] snowrealmagic .*outside the tested range
shell grep -c "Snow! Real Magic loaded" logs/latest.log; true
look the Calendar line once; no injection failure

## SQ-SRM-02 | A torch melts a snowy poppy layer by layer and leaves the poppy
@group A
@commands Snowy poppy (3 layers) on grass, torch on the block beside it; randomTickSpeed 1000, 60 s; probe the block
@pass the poppy stands where the snow was (`minecraft:poppy`); no air
@fails air: `Melting.meltTo` not reading the held block (compat/SnowRealMagic.held); still snow: `snowrealmagic:snow` missing from `#creativecompat:melting/meltable` (melting_tags.js, `global.has('snowrealmagic')`)
@absent snowrealmagic:snow (Snow! Real Magic 6.5.4, added after the last /dumpall dump of 2026-11-13)
> forceload add 3000 3000 3031 3031
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> time set 6000
> weather clear 1000000
> execute unless entity m3 run pbot spawn m3 3016 -60 3016 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> setblock 3004 -60 3004 snowrealmagic:snow[layers=3]{Block:"minecraft:poppy"}
> setblock 3005 -60 3004 minecraft:torch
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 1000
sleep 60
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> execute if block 3004 -60 3004 minecraft:poppy run say SRM02_POPPY
> execute if block 3004 -60 3004 minecraft:air run say SRM02_AIR
expect SRM02_POPPY
reject SRM02_AIR
> fill 3004 -60 3004 3005 -60 3004 minecraft:air

## SQ-SRM-03 | A snowy poppy placed in the Nether: the snow fizzes away, the poppy stays
@group A
@commands In the Nether on a placed grass block: `setblock` a snowy poppy; wait 2 s; probe
@pass the block is `minecraft:poppy`
@fails air: `Melting.onPlaced` did not defer to the next tick for a Snow! Real Magic block (the held block is filled in after onPlace); still snow: `#creativecompat:melting/ultrawarm_instant` lacks it
@absent snowrealmagic:snow (Snow! Real Magic 6.5.4, added after the last /dumpall dump of 2026-11-13)
> execute in minecraft:the_nether run forceload add 0 0
> execute in minecraft:the_nether run fill -1 100 -1 1 102 1 minecraft:air
> execute in minecraft:the_nether run setblock 0 100 0 minecraft:grass_block
> execute in minecraft:the_nether run setblock 0 101 0 snowrealmagic:snow[layers=2]{Block:"minecraft:poppy"}
sleep 2
> execute in minecraft:the_nether if block 0 101 0 minecraft:poppy run say SRM03_POPPY
expect SRM03_POPPY
> execute in minecraft:the_nether run fill -1 100 -1 1 102 1 minecraft:air

## SQ-SRM-04 | Immersive Weathering's rain melt on a snowy dandelion keeps the dandelion
@group A
@commands Snowy dandelion (1 layer) on open grass; `/weather rain`; randomTickSpeed 1000, 60 s; probe
@pass `minecraft:dandelion` stands there; never air
@fails air: IwSnowMeltSrmMixin not ahead of Immersive Weathering's HEAD callback (priority 900 vs 1000), or gated off (needs both mods)
@absent snowrealmagic:snow (Snow! Real Magic 6.5.4, added after the last /dumpall dump of 2026-11-13)
> forceload add 3040 3000 3071 3031
> execute unless entity m4 run pbot spawn m4 3056 -60 3016 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> setblock 3044 -60 3004 snowrealmagic:snow[layers=1]{Block:"minecraft:dandelion"}
> weather rain 1000000
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 1000
sleep 60
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> weather clear 1000000
> execute if block 3044 -60 3004 minecraft:dandelion run say SRM04_DANDELION
> execute if block 3044 -60 3004 minecraft:air run say SRM04_AIR
expect SRM04_DANDELION
reject SRM04_AIR
> setblock 3044 -60 3004 minecraft:air

## SQ-SRM-05 | Grass with snow on it never spreads; the same grass without snow does
@group A
@commands Two 9x9 dirt pads ringed by stone, a grass block in each center; snow 1 layer on the first center only; day, randomTickSpeed 1000, 60 s; count grass on each pad
@pass pad 1 (snowed): no grass besides the center; pad 2: 3 or more grass blocks; both centers still grass
@fails pad 1 grew grass: SrmGrassSpreadMixin not first (priority 900 vs Snow! Real Magic's 1000) or snowOnTop missed the layer; pad 2 no spread: the tick cancels too early (light, area loaded)
> forceload add 3080 3000 3131 3031
> execute unless entity m5 run pbot spawn m5 3100 -60 3016 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> fill 3083 -61 3003 3093 -61 3013 minecraft:stone
> fill 3084 -61 3004 3092 -61 3012 minecraft:dirt
> setblock 3088 -61 3008 minecraft:grass_block
> setblock 3088 -60 3008 minecraft:snow[layers=1]
> fill 3103 -61 3003 3113 -61 3013 minecraft:stone
> fill 3104 -61 3004 3112 -61 3012 minecraft:dirt
> setblock 3108 -61 3008 minecraft:grass_block
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 1000
sleep 60
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> fill 3084 -61 3004 3092 -61 3012 minecraft:moss_block replace minecraft:grass_block
> fill 3104 -61 3004 3112 -61 3012 minecraft:moss_block replace minecraft:grass_block
look the two "Successfully filled N block(s)" replies (grass counted as it is swapped for moss): pad 1 = 1, pad 2 >= 3
> fill 3083 -60 3003 3113 -60 3013 minecraft:air
> fill 3083 -61 3003 3113 -61 3013 minecraft:grass_block

## SQ-SRM-06 | Snow! Real Magic's ice melt is off; Serene Seasons melts snow and ice outside winter
@group A
@commands Calendar season set to mid spring; open ice in a temperate biome and a snowy poppy; randomTickSpeed 3, 10 minutes with a bot near; probe
@pass the snowy poppy turns into the poppy (Serene Seasons' melt, SereneSeasonsSrmMeltMixin), the ice turns to water by Serene Seasons' rule; a snowy poppy beside a sea lantern does not melt in winter
@fails nothing melts: the Calendar postApply did not drop Snow! Real Magic's cancel (no boot line, SQ-SRM-01)
@draft needs the Calendar season command and a temperate seasonal biome; the next runner writes the steps (writeup test SRM-12)

## SQ-SRM-07 | Magma stops Snow! Real Magic's snowfall within fireRange
@group B
@commands Snowy plains clearing, magma block at the surface; `/weather thunder` 10 minutes; count snow within 3 of the magma and 5 to 8 out
@pass no snow layer within 3 of the magma; snow beyond
@fails snow beside the magma: SrmWorldTickMixin not applied (the convert redirect), or `[melting] magmaStopsFreezing` off
@draft needs a snowy biome (normal world, group B) and a long thunderstorm; steps to be written by the next runner (writeup test SRM-04)

## CQ-SRM-01 | Wading a snowy plant and a snowy berry bush; a snow-topped oak stair walks like wood
@group client
@commands Client on a scratch server: walk through a snowy tall grass and a snowy sweet berry bush (3 layers), read WTHIT; walk on a snow-topped oak stair (`setblock ~ ~ ~ snowrealmagic:stairs[facing=north]{Block:"minecraft:oak_stairs"}`), read WTHIT Run Speed
@pass the snowy plant walks through like 3 snow layers; the berry bush in snow slows like a bush (0.36), no Snow! Real Magic 0.8 stuck; WTHIT on the stair shows Wood 1.10x; no rubber-banding
@fails solid snowy plant: `snowrealmagic:snow` not in `#creativecompat:passthrough_layers` or SrmSnowCollisionMixin off; stair at 1.00x: CamoSpeed not reading the held block
@draft client row: steps by the next runner (writeup tests SRM-07, SRM-17, SRM-24)
